Dear Lennart,

> I was wondering whether you have tried using Autoconf and Automake for
> OmicABEL. It looks like you try to support several platforms and depend
> on various libraries. Autoconf can help with those.

You're absolutely right. The initial idea was to provide several examples of
makefiles depending on the architecture (compiler, BLAS/LAPACK version, OS, ...).
